OpenCode Permission Reviewer

The reviewer policy and prompt text in src/policy.ts are adapted from the
OpenAI Codex Guardian auto-review policy and policy template:

  https://github.com/openai/codex/tree/main/codex-rs/core/src/guardian

Parts of that policy are paraphrased or reproduced with edits; the taxonomy,
the risk/authorization ladders, and several definitions derive from it. This
adaptation adds OpenCode permission semantics, a human-escalation outcome,
confidence scoring, tool-free operation, and SSH / local-script / Git evidence
enrichment.

